{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id248817219"}, "name":{"label":"RobMac3and1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-05-22T23:08:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.10.3"}, "id":{"label":"9956108615"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible sarcastic comments"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a patronising, annoying and typically bias to left politics. I’m not even politically motivated and it annoys me. It’s not humorous at all, they need much better material, better still stick to weather facts rather than pretending to do comedy. Delete", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id43748895"}, "name":{"label":"lL lE lE"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-05-21T23:05:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"9952781172"}, "title":{"label":"Ok"}, "content":{"label":"Used to be good, but has taken a bit of a dip for me. Weather underground used to be the original weather source but now it has been removed and is locked behind a premium wall. New sources seem far less accurate at predicting the weather correctly. Despite there being lots of app customisation, you can only have a very over complicated layout with lots of useless information to me or an incredibly basic one. There’s no in between with just the parameters you want to see. Finally, the same jokey lines are used too often and there’s no enough. It gets boring hearing the same one repeated so often. It’s been a great app and good fun, but I’ve now moved to another weather app. Plus it’s annoying having weather underground taken away after I paid for the app and used it for a couple of years", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-03T16:33:29-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
